    "conceptSummary": "Replaying acknowledged Pub/Sub messages with seek.",
    "correctRationale": "Seeking to a past timestamp redelivers messages only if they are still retained, and acknowledged messages are retained only when retain-acked-messages is enabled. With that flag on and retention covering two days, a seek to a timestamp two days ago makes the updated pipeline reprocess everything since then. A snapshot is another way to replay, but it is restored through a seek to the snapshot, not a seek to a timestamp.",
